'release:Clear the assignee and set the task open. Only the holder, unless --force' /
'dep:Record that this task waits on another. A cycle is refused and nothing is written' /
'priority:Set priority from 0 (highest) to 4. 2 is the default and is not stored' /
'conflict:Record that two tasks touch the same files, so they should not run at once. Symmetric; /`ready/` flags a task whose partner is in progress' /
'parallel:Mark a task safe to run beside any other task' /
'sync:Raise the id counters to the adapter'/''s highest ids and report drift; never writes the adapter' /
'export:Mirror the disk tasks one way into an issue tracker; the files stay the source of truth. A second run with nothing changed sends no write' /
'init:Write /`/[tasks/]/` into this checkout'/''s /`.rtok.toml/` and seed the counter from existing tasks' /
    )
    _describe -t commands 'rtok help task commands' commands "$@"
